    "sourceGaps": [
      "1999E1: Attributed Volume 2, Anton Sirota / IChO International Information Centre / IUVENTA, Bratislava, 2009; physical331–334, printed733–736. Actual titres, iodine concentration, announced exact thiosulphate concentration, numeric rate constants and the separate answer sheet are absent. The brief printed key gives orders and a calculation method, not measured data. It includes the mean under B5 although the question labels it B6. All procedural instructions and native B-1–B-6 identifiers are preserved within their connected practical assignment. Teaching copying, distribution and adaptation require Volume 2 attribution; no blanket commercial permission is asserted.",
      "1999E2: Attributed Volume 2, Anton Sirota / IChO International Information Centre / IUVENTA, Bratislava, 2009; physical335–340, printed737–742. Native expected test tables and NMR assignment tables are retained; actual participant observations, separately supplied spectra and answer sheets are not obtained. The S table's placement of peak numbers/blank lines differs from its assignment graphic; both remain explicit. The final Y graphic retains its erroneous S heading. No new experimental measurements or reconstructed spectra are supplied. Teaching copying, distribution and adaptation require Volume 2 attribution; no blanket commercial permission is asserted."
    ],
